      </svg>
    </button>
    <a href="mailto:hello@ethinstitute.org?subject=Ethereum%20Institute%20Inquiry" class="btn-nav">Reach Out</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<main class="funding-page" id="funding-main">
  <section class="intro-grid">
    <div class="intro-col fu d1">
      <h1 class="page-title">Funding</h1>
      <div class="intro-text">
        <p>Ethereum Institutional is an independent non-profit dedicated to accelerating the institutional adoption of Ethereum, its L2s, applications and overall ecosystem.</p>
        <p>It is funded by mission-aligned partners across the ecosystem.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="contribute-box fu d3">
      <div class="contribute-label">Contribute</div>
      <div class="ens-name">ethinstitute.eth</div>
      <div class="address-row">
        <a href="https://etherscan.io/address/0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000000" class="address-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="View address on Etherscan">
          <span id="addr-display">0x0000…0000</span>
          <svg class="ext-icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M6 3h7v7M13 3L6 10M11 8v5H3V5h5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="square"/>
